Hello Git community,

I am preparing my Outreachy application for the December 2026
internship round and have prepared a proposal based on the project:

=E2=80=9CReduce Git's global state to enable its libification.=E2=80=9D

I have attached my current proposal draft for review.

I would appreciate feedback, particularly on:

- Whether the proposed technical scope is appropriate and achievable.
- Whether the proposed implementation approach is suitable.
- Whether the regression-testing strategy covers the important cases.
- Any technical concerns or improvements I should consider.

I would be grateful for your suggestions before finalizing the application.

Thank you for your time and guidance.

Regards
Srujith

